  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types | devDependencies | patch | `0.4.13` -> `0.4.20` | [source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types</summary>\n\n### [`v0.4.20`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/releases/v0.4.20)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/compare/v0.4.19...v0.4.20)\n\n-   Protect against unhandled exception ([#&#8203;171](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/171)) [@&#8203;lukeapage](https://renovatebot.com/gh/lukeapage)\n-   Fix extraneous semicolon ([#&#8203;168](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/168)) [@&#8203;eps1lon](https://renovatebot.com/gh/eps1lon)\n\n### [`v0.4.19`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/releases/v0.4.19)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/compare/v0.4.18...v0.4.19)\n\n-   Fix babel readonly ([#&#8203;167](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/167)) [@&#8203;eps1lon](https://renovatebot.com/gh/eps1lon) \n-   Remove npm lockfiles ([#&#8203;164](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/164)) [@&#8203;vikr01](https://renovatebot.com/gh/vikr01)\n-   [docs] Fix url for devDependency status ([#&#8203;166](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/166)) [@&#8203;vikr01](https://renovatebot.com/gh/vikr01)\n\n### [`v0.4.18`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/releases/v0.4.18)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/compare/v0.4.17...v0.4.18)\n\n-   Avoid removeNewlyUnusedIdentifiers when destructuring Arrays ([#&#8203;162](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/162))\n\n### [`v0.4.17`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/releases/v0.4.17)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/compare/v0.4.16...v0.4.17)\n\n-   [fix] Avoid removeNewlyUnusedIdentifiers when encountering destructuring ([#&#8203;161](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/161))\n\n### [`v0.4.16`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/releases/v0.4.16)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/compare/v0.4.15...v0.4.16)\n\n-   [new] update Babel 7 ([#&#8203;155](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/155))\n-   [fix] Remove unused MemberExpression root identifiers ([#&#8203;158](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/158))\n-   [fix] Use regex.test(str) instead of str.match(regex) ([#&#8203;152](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/152))\n-   [fix] Replace Set with WeakSet for collecting removed paths ([#&#8203;151](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/151))\n\n### [`v0.4.15`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/releases/v0.4.15)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/compare/v0.4.14...v0.4.15)\n\n-   Remove newly unreferenced VariableDeclarators ([#&#8203;146](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/pull/146))\n\n### [`v0.4.14`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/releases/v0.4.14)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/compare/v0.4.13...v0.4.14)\n\n-   Handle recursive code ([#&#8203;148](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/148))\n-   [core] Upgrade the dependencies ([#&#8203;141](https://renovatebot.com/gh/oliviertassinari/babel-plugin-transform-react-remove-prop-types/issues/141))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovatebot.com/gh/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
